<blocks>
  <block id="d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e" category="cell"></block>
  <block id="8efc36afc2e7202a9c9bda00b8e8a75d" category="section-title">授權總覽</block>
  <block id="f008ecd5469e24eee31eb4e2e4a1e23f" category="paragraph">下列授權選項適用於新客戶。</block>
  <block id="a47bcecd4f4a1f89ad4e82bca88975ab" category="list-text">Keystone Flex 訂閱</block>
  <block id="0e1a6eb7eed81777ed9d0610be51df3b" category="paragraph">先前的個別節點授權模式仍適用於已購買授權或正在訂閱市場的現有客戶。</block>
  <block id="19bcaffbe8361f9d452beabc8065f223" category="section-title">容量型授權套件</block>
  <block id="e7cf94fb6f7d5441689859c52b410a98" category="paragraph">容量型授權可讓您針對Cloud Volumes ONTAP 容量的每個TiB付費。授權與您的NetApp帳戶相關聯、只要授權有足夠的容量可用、您就能根據授權向多個系統收取費用。</block>
  <block id="1f0b82560627b660c6c6958a1df834b8" category="section-title">支援的組態</block>
  <block id="69c3857459c8cf827b42c61c1b02fdd2" category="paragraph">以隨成長付費訂閱為基礎的服務、可為偏好營運成本使用模式的使用者、提供無縫的混合雲體驗、以供預先支付資本支出或租賃之用。</block>
  <block id="c2d000408838a6b2031536d54c067fd9" category="paragraph">充電是根據Cloud Volumes ONTAP 您在Keystone Flex訂閱中一或多對的已認可容量大小而計算。</block>
  <block id="e9c44bbfd795a5d63d74c6a77afee70d" category="summary">法律聲明提供版權聲明、商標、專利等存取權限。</block>
  <block id="30d965eef5ba25c6b9998ae38270b43e" category="doc">法律聲明</block>
  <block id="6016a2b341113bf496b719905398ecd2" category="section-title">版權</block>
  <block id="126a02652da6de02962cf1b654fd6376" category="section-title">商標</block>
  <block id="c4ce4761e466527d26b3e3d5ed1006fd" category="paragraph">NetApp 、 NetApp 標誌及 NetApp 商標頁面上列出的標章均為 NetApp 、 Inc. 的商標。其他公司與產品名稱可能為其各自所有者的商標。</block>
  <block id="be89498d2f8a22ce47c02ba9795fe2af" category="section-title">專利</block>
  <block id="d0b19d36be2c5f16e9aef46c8a452d3d" category="paragraph">如需最新的 NetApp 擁有專利清單、請參閱：</block>
  <block id="56c34c6410dd45c5cec44149ad0ce037" category="section-title">隱私權政策</block>
  <block id="c0227cef6f07a8cd2ac72f2945b031aa" category="section-title">開放原始碼</block>
  <block id="9b73989307c1975dfa4d5e1581e4afe8" category="paragraph">通知檔案提供有關 NetApp 軟體所使用之協力廠商版權與授權的資訊。</block>
  <block id="c4d6a904ef528003bf03bc2e65cffd26" category="section-title">支援的升級途徑</block>
  <block id="33871b6190a8d5adbe8b15282054766c" category="sidebar">新增功能</block>
  <block id="56ef2682280ac110060b881925a87b80" category="sidebar">Google Cloud</block>
  <block id="150a34e7bbdf7765066eae5fadb9f919" category="sidebar">儲存限制</block>
  <block id="37439fa615a442ec183c1c602f9755f1" category="paragraph">容量型授權的形式為_package_。當您部署Cloud Volumes ONTAP 一套解決方案時、您可以根據業務需求、從多個授權套件中進行選擇。</block>
  <block id="deb56fb5a824215375b16e72749e2aa3" category="inline-link">深入瞭解這些授權選項</block>
  <block id="8a11b7df22322ab2814174e7745c863f" category="inline-link">關於本產品的注意事項ONTAP</block>
  <block id="a65d010a2b24f9e4a0919b7faf52d022" category="list-text"><block ref="a65d010a2b24f9e4a0919b7faf52d022" category="inline-link-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="dfb01a7b38cba8284269f37f00622809" category="paragraph">請閱讀這些附註、深入瞭解升級至此版本的相關資訊。</block>
  <block id="b78b1188c7979365981f7c88049f9366" category="section-title">如何升級</block>
  <block id="75026846c1403e202a52bdb027762fbb" category="section-title">停機</block>
  <block id="c46270a9bdf069bd0e015f7953e02355" category="paragraph"><block ref="c46270a9bdf069bd0e015f7953e02355" category="inline-link-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="52009bb7ee17227f566cd26a02caee56" category="inline-link-macro"><block ref="52009bb7ee17227f566cd26a02caee56" category="inline-link-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="a1a9afcf552a769c282769271829889a" category="paragraph"><block ref="a1a9afcf552a769c282769271829889a" category="inline-link-macro-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="f99aa604031e5049799e73b5c3748a98" category="inline-link-macro"><block ref="f99aa604031e5049799e73b5c3748a98" category="inline-link-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="5d545fe5152641e2ebe654e336e520e5" category="paragraph"><block ref="5d545fe5152641e2ebe654e336e520e5" category="inline-link-macro-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="88e5eabd3917048b6927c42496b98f86" category="inline-link-macro"><block ref="88e5eabd3917048b6927c42496b98f86" category="inline-link-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="dd38f906b37d412de7d1c1dcf4cbf31c" category="paragraph"><block ref="dd38f906b37d412de7d1c1dcf4cbf31c" category="inline-link-macro-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="8acb58cbd50ef1b468a020ee0bd351d3" category="inline-link-macro"><block ref="8acb58cbd50ef1b468a020ee0bd351d3" category="inline-link-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="2352c4e1f4d0024ade0869e00e6243f4" category="paragraph"><block ref="2352c4e1f4d0024ade0869e00e6243f4" category="inline-link-macro-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="be11c74c1dd7f307bb80183a90dc2067" category="sidebar">開始使用</block>
  <block id="6beccc67ff905f7da0b29dece26b0485" category="sidebar">Amazon Web Services</block>
  <block id="e646e16bee8b32e6ea29e30d01970a6c" category="sidebar">限制</block>
  <block id="1668ca1bd914c1d847f23b491319ac91" category="sidebar">Microsoft Azure</block>
  <block id="813011e2103649bb71f124adedcc10ea" category="sidebar">部落格與社群</block>
  <block id="dd490b81914dd945601e442a41cb4222" category="sidebar">NetApp社群</block>
  <block id="b5cb41a6703cf18b4cecd5a0817f91cf" category="section-title">升級附註</block>
  <block id="6b32e99bddf60938239aabe092cb4c16" category="paragraph">有多種授權選項可供Cloud Volumes ONTAP 選擇。每個選項都能讓您選擇符合需求的消費模式。</block>
  <block id="27fe4eb3edbaff8f250e2d51f7462681" category="inline-link">套件</block>
  <block id="13dba612a4f942a80cbc82c5f678d57c" category="inline-link">更多關於容量型授權的資訊</block>
  <block id="d994821c78c4538d3406d1baa52bc470" category="paragraph"><block ref="55cb08b70ffaa99b7ec18860c0180e14" category="inline-link-rx"></block> <block ref="7c9574dfed81dad53ed1c2acf3a874b5" category="inline-link-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="2dc71138ad7976e187566f7ce79883cc" category="list-text">升級 HA 配對不會中斷營運， I/O 也不會中斷。在此不中斷升級程序期間，每個節點都會一起升級，以繼續為用戶端提供 I/O 服務。</block>
  <block id="8d051a62e2d203f6829d7d7282bfaad2" category="inline-link">FabricPool最佳實踐</block>
  <block id="1fa61fc2f5b77b2d0fa94849b6af3dbb" category="paragraph">透過基於容量的許可，每個Cloud Volumes ONTAP系統都支援分層到物件儲存。總分層容量可以擴展到雲端提供者的儲存桶限制。雖然許可證沒有施加容量限制，但您應該遵循<block ref="c6ca22161b60218024eaf899637cc82e" category="inline-link-rx"></block>確保在配置和管理分層時實現最佳效能、可靠性和成本效率。</block>
  <block id="1d3b6bcaa662fb815c64aec0bffd0aa5" category="inline-link-macro">了解控制台通知您時如何升級</block>
  <block id="3c031b939f6ec312ee601d021e7a6644" category="sidebar">NetApp控制台</block>
  <block id="cc58d3a9b2264c4fd8cb1d3f61b90bdc" category="sidebar">NetApp資料服務</block>
  <block id="57a0ba977b3ce94f8d770dc7f07f0621" category="paragraph">Cloud Volumes ONTAP的升級必須透過控制台完成。您不應使用系統管理員或 CLI 升級Cloud Volumes ONTAP 。這樣做會影響系統穩定性。</block>
  <block id="e8d1ba67e4c7362e24e23edc094c913a" category="inline-link-macro">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.18.1 的注意事項</block>
  <block id="cbacdd329731dd3da20817c0b9394825" category="list-text"><block ref="cbacdd329731dd3da20817c0b9394825" category="inline-link-macro-rx"></block></block>
  <block id="777aa7f6fc6d119be846af0333b88f27" category="list-text">單節點系統的升級會使系統離線最多 25 分鐘，在此期間 I/O 會中斷。</block>
  <block id="b0f94eabc09f0c220518c1307ae04061" category="summary">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.19.1 包含一項新的增強功能。</block>
  <block id="75772205d115792b7e022b200e4e6a95" category="doc">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.19.1 的新增功能</block>
  <block id="98236d20e4670591965cd4dfd21922a9" category="paragraph">現在您可以部署和升級到 Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.19.1。您可以在 NetApp Console 中查看此版本的基本版本以及可用於部署和升級的最新修補程式版本。</block>
  <block id="047a301669757aed8837c50560f7106c" category="sidebar">這些版本資訊說明 Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.19.1 的新功能、限制和已知問題。</block>
  <block id="acfc3dd2bf5b3c0cdaff3742dc4e677d" category="sidebar">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.19.1 版本說明</block>
  <block id="baa4551a28b9b9b693078dff3d23a9c8" category="sidebar">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.19.1 版本說明</block>
  <block id="1a523ba4ece9125275b92ebb41e3cf23" category="inline-link">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 文檔</block>
  <block id="beecc6122c1c255f72dcdc6b55547dd4" category="paragraph">要進一步瞭解 Cloud Volumes ONTAP 的功能、支援的組態、限制等資訊，請參閱<block ref="ea5552b8f9c3766b3dbd6170754013e4" category="inline-link-rx"></block>。</block>
  <block id="e5db128c051c458ffd6845d0676ec51e" category="section-title">9.19.1（2026年8月10日）</block>
  <block id="11a01aa0f08b855e4b36226d278e2f8b" category="paragraph">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 9.19.1 正式版 (GA) 現已發布，目前僅支援在 Amazon Web Services (AWS) 和 Google Cloud 上部署和升級。此版本不支援在 Microsoft Azure (Azure) 上部署和升級。</block>
  <block id="779179d87fedb0f1d19bc08238c479a7" category="paragraph"><block ref="675aaf3b5e84a93fbce00d949a5f961a" category="inline-link-rx"></block>。</block>
  <block id="1ba2a5867ae8351321f6970817584236" category="paragraph">您可以在 AWS 和 Google Cloud 中將 Cloud Volumes ONTAP 從 9.18.1 升級到 9.19.1。主控台將提示您將符合條件的 Cloud Volumes ONTAP 系統升級至此版本。</block>
  <block id="2962b8222cacec8cb18f5c8cdf1f04eb" category="admonition">在 Azure 中，不會提示您升級至 9.19.1，因為此版本在該雲端供應商中無法部署和升級。</block>
  <block id="6b9b9e55102bb13f1ca535f28c0d3a98" category="doc">Cloud Volumes ONTAP 的法律聲明</block>
</blocks>